lName":"Rep. Garbarino, Andrew R. [R-NY-2]","party":"R","state":"NY"}],"summaries":[{"actionDate":"2025-12-18","actionDesc":"Introduced in House","text":"<p><b>Veteran Suicide Prevention Act</b></p> <p>This bill requires the Department of Veterans Affairs (VA) to complete a review of the deaths of all covered veterans who died by suicide during the five-year period preceding the enactment of this bill. Covered veterans are those who received VA hospital care or medical services during the five-year period preceding the death of the veteran. </p> <p>The VA shall report on the results of the review and make such report publicly available.</p>","updateDate":"2026-04-10T12:52:04Z","versionCode":"00"}],"title":"Veteran Suicide Prevention Act","type":"hr","updateDate":"2026-09-19T23:37:18Z","updateDateIncludingText":"2026-09-19T23:37:18Z"}
